/T (My name's Olive ! Youtube channel name is olivegr33n. I've got almost 750 subscribers and climbing :D Favourite colour, you guessed it, is olive green. I've had labeled essas for about 4 years, with my first labeled one being Kichi \(ferret\) and my first actual one being Orange Kitty \(an.. orange kitty.\) I look for especially soft fur, floppiness, and non-clumping stuffing in an essa. I usually bring Maverick \(my main essa\) to school with me, but not many other places. I remember one time I was in my Outdoor Education class with my boyfriend and best friends and I had Maverick in my bag. Over the course of the class I slowly took him out and after he was already halfway out of the bag my boyfriend finally noticed him lol. And one of my hobbies is making dragon puppets ^^)
/E (My name's Olive ! Youtube channel name is olivegr33n. I've got almost 750 subscribers and climbing :D Favourite colour, you guessed it, is olive green. I've had labeled essas for about 4 years, with my first labeled one being Kichi \(ferret\) and my first actual one being Orange Kitty \(an.. orange kitty.\) I look for especially soft fur, floppiness, and non-clumping stuffing in an essa. I usually bring Maverick \(my main essa\) to school with me, but not many other places. I remember one time I was in my Outdoor Education class with my boyfriend and best friends and I had Maverick in my bag. Over the course of the class I slowly took him out and after he was already halfway out of the bag my boyfriend finally noticed him lol. And one of my hobbies is making dragon puppets ^^)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
